OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot by police after woman
OL,4,Astabbed at property
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been shot by police after a
OL,7,Fwoman was stabbed at a property in
OL,8,FLuton.
OL,10,FShots were fired by armed officers at
OL,11,Fan address in Cardigan Street at about
OL,12,F12:50 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe man was struck in the arm and leg
OL,15,Fafter a Bedfordshire Police officer
OL,16,Fdischarged four shots, while another
OL,17,Ffired a baton round.
OL,19,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,20,FConduct (IOPC) said it was now
OL,21,Finvestigating the police response.
